# This build's context is the REPOSITORY ROOT (the app imports the team's
# shared stylesheet from shared/styles.css), so frontend/.dockerignore is not
# the file BuildKit reads -- a context-root .dockerignore would be, and the
# repo has none. BuildKit looks for <dockerfile>.dockerignore first, which is
# this file, so the ignores live here and no shared file has to be touched.
#
# Without it the context is the whole repo: five students' node_modules, the
# checked-in venv, and .git, all uploaded to the daemon on every build.

# Everything, then re-admit only what this image needs.
*

# The shared theme, at the path src/styles/app.css imports it from.
!shared/styles.css

# The app itself.
!LeHoaLong/frontend

# Build inputs and outputs that must not come along even so.
LeHoaLong/frontend/node_modules
LeHoaLong/frontend/dist
LeHoaLong/frontend/.gitignore
LeHoaLong/frontend/Dockerfile
LeHoaLong/frontend/Dockerfile.dockerignore
LeHoaLong/frontend/.dockerignore
